%% UI owners: packages/message/src/lib/components/drawer/chat-settings/chat-settings.component.ts:1；packages/message/src/lib/services/message.service.ts:1；src/app/message-host/runtime/im-gate/helix/helixTauriImGate.service.ts:1（实际命令与关联回灌）
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：群主或成员修改某个人的群内昵称，之后群里所有消息、成员列表、系统提示里这个人都显示新昵称。
  Note over UI,Web: 合同登记快照（不等于当前实现或实测）：mock=implemented；helix=implemented；dual=yes；personaLocal=no；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: changeMemberNickname(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_update_member_nickname", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_update_member_nickname", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_update_member_nickname", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 设置成员在本群的昵称 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /channel/member/change/nickname
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  Go-->>WS: WS authority event or canonical result
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(authority bytes)
  E->>IM: apply authoritative event before settlement
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction channel_member + channel + cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit {event,data}（im:channel:member-nickname）
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ 原始事件 → adapter 映射 kind → Angular 消费
  Sink-->>FFI: FFI batch raw {event,data}
  Sink-->>Web: Web EventBatch raw {event,data}
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：四类成员容器全部 patch：members / adminUsers / boss / owner 中 userId 命中项的 nickName === 新昵称；patch 必须 immutable：命中项是新对象（引用不等于原对象），未命中项引用保持不变；members.length / memberCount 不变
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：不得只改 members 而漏 adminUsers / boss / owner —— 漏改会让管理员列表与负责人栏继续显示旧名（四容器必须逐个断言）；未命中 userId 时不得抛错，且仍必须 emit memberNickname（graceful 契约：下游自行按 id 匹配）
  Note over E,Sink: 原始事件名（按触发分支）：im:channel:member-nickname；客户端 kind/action 由 adapter 映射，不是原始 Emit 名称
